@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### Health check PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/postgres

### JWT token (after setting Jwt:DemoPassword = lab2-demo-password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "password": "lab2-demo-password"
}

### GET users with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=3

### GET project tasks with DB filters + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/tasks?status=InProgress&priority=High&page=1&pageSize=10

### Create project (requires Bearer token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "API Test Project",
  "description": "Created from HTTP file",
  "ownerId": 1
}

### Duplicate member -> expected 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "role": "Member"
}

### Invalid assignee -> expected 400 Bad Request (user 5 is not member of project 1 in seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Invalid assignee test",
  "description": "Business rule comes from PostgreSQL",
  "assigneeId": 5,
  "status": "New",
  "priority": "Normal",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Change task status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/4/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Project status statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/task-stats
